{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cardtographer is a stylized 3D graphic deck-builder in a roguelike style where you choose one or more champions to fight the evil that has taken over the land. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In an intense mix of deck-builder, RPG, and roguelike genres, your chosen champions collect gold and experience in battles with demons, monsters, and dragons, improving their decks and unlocking cards permantly, to finally defeat the opposing enemies ravaging the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624160/extras/Untitled_000000-ezgif.com-optimize__1_.gif?t=1744799885\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features of the Demo:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three different champion classes all featuring their own deck, each having multiple playing styles and tactics to be discovered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 125 cards , many can be upgraded, crafted and bought (some after an initial unlock)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose one or more champions, combining their advantages and\u00a0reduce their weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 15 Map-Events with choices which can lead to positive or negative effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original Music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One procedural generated Worldmap you can fully progress through two times to gain XP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local Play, <u><strong>but online play for the demo will be enabled in future</strong></u> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One, two or four Champions per Team</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3624160?t=1744799885","background_raw":"https://store.aka